    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "Analyze this sales call transcript:\n\n{{$json.body.message.transcript}}\nYou are an expert sales call analyst for Apex Cycle, an AI automation agency that builds custom automation systems for businesses.\n\nYour job is to read a sales call transcript and extract structured intelligence that helps the sales team decide who to follow up with and how.\n\nSCORING GUIDE — qualificationScore (0 to 100):\nStart at 50, then adjust based on what you hear in the call.\n\nAdd points:\n+20 if they confirmed a budget above $1000/month\n+15 if they want to start within the next 3 months\n+10 if they described a specific business problem automation could solve\n+10 if they are the owner or decision maker\n+5 if they were engaged, asked questions, or agreed to a next step\n\nSubtract points:\n-20 if no budget was mentioned or budget is under $500\n-15 if timeline is vague or more than 6 months away\n-10 if they seemed distracted, rushed, or gave one-word answers\n-15 if they said they are not interested or asked to be removed\n-10 if they never answered the qualification questions\n\nSENTIMENT:\npositive — engaged, curious, asked questions, agreed to next step\nneutral — polite but vague, non-committal, gave short answers\nnegative — dismissive, annoyed, not interested, hung up early\n\nNEXT ACTION — choose exactly one based on the score:\nScore 70 or above → book_strategy_call\nScore 50 to 69 → send_case_study_and_follow_up\nScore 30 to 49 → add_to_nurture_sequence\nScore below 30 → close_lead_not_qualified\n\nOUTPUT RULES:\n- Return only valid JSON, no extra text, no markdown, no explanation\n- Use exactly these field names\n\n{\n  \"qualificationScore\": integer between 0 and 100,\n  \"sentiment\": \"positive\" or \"neutral\" or \"negative\",\n  \"budget\": \"exact words they used about budget, or not mentioned if they never said\",\n  \"timeline\": \"exact words they used about timeline, or not mentioned if they never said\",\n  \"painPoints\": [\"specific problem 1\", \"specific problem 2\"],\n  \"nextAction\": \"one of the four options from the next action rules\",\n  \"summary\": \"2-3 sentence note written to a sales rep explaining what happened on the call, what the lead said, and what to do next. Max 400 characters.\",\n  \"keyInsights\": [\"insight 1\", \"insight 2\", \"insight 3\"],\n  \"isQualified\": true or false based on whether score is 60 or above,\n  \"decisionMaker\": true or false based on whether they indicated they own or run the business\n}",
